-- en/01-help/argv --
crater user fields --help
-- en/01-help/exit --
0
-- en/01-help/stdout --
Get enabled user fields and deployment labels

Usage:
  crater user fields [flags]

Global Flags:
  -h, --help             Help for crater
      --json             Output in raw JSON format
      --no-interactive   Disable interactive prompts
